WEBVTT

00:02.585 --> 00:05.046
Are ya ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:05.130 --> 00:07.173
I can't  hear  you.
我听不到你说话。

00:07.257 --> 00:08.842
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain.
孩子们：
是的，是的，船长。

00:08.925 --> 00:11.136
♪ Ohh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:11.219 --> 00:13.304
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.388 --> 00:15.223
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:15.306 --> 00:17.392
Captain: ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
队长：♪ 吸水性的，黄色的
他是多孔的 ♪

00:17.475 --> 00:19.394
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:19.477 --> 00:21.354
Captain: ♪ If nautical nonsense
be somethin' you wish ♪
船长：♪ 如果是航海方面的废话
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:21.438 --> 00:23.064
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:23.148 --> 00:24.649
Captain: ♪ Then drop on the
deck and flop like a fish ♪
队长：♪ 那么就降落在
像鱼一样翻牌和翻牌♪

00:24.733 --> 00:26.443
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:26.526 --> 00:28.194
Captain: ♪ Ready? ♪
队长：♪ 准备好了吗？ ♪

00:28.278 --> 00:30.029
All: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
全部： ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:30.113 --> 00:31.364
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:31.448 --> 00:33.366
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:33.450 --> 00:36.035
Captain: ♪ SpongeBob
SquarePants ♪
队长：♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤♪

00:56.973 --> 00:58.224
you wanted to see me, sir?
先生，你想见我吗？

00:58.308 --> 01:01.603
Pull up a seat, boy.
拉个座位来，孩子。

01:02.979 --> 01:04.898
Mr. Krabs,
there aren't any chairs.
蟹老板先生，
没有椅子。

01:04.981 --> 01:06.649
Sit down.
坐下。

01:06.733 --> 01:09.319
Now, you've worked here
for quite some time, boy.
现在，你已经在这里工作了
已经有一段时间了，孩子。

01:09.402 --> 01:12.280
Oh, yes, sir, and they've been
the best years of my life, sir.
哦，是的，先生，他们已经
我一生中最美好的岁月，先生。

01:12.363 --> 01:16.075
That sad fact aside, midway
through today's lunch rush
抛开这个悲伤的事实不谈，中途
通过今天的午餐高峰

01:16.159 --> 01:23.041
we ran out of
the secret ingredient
to the secret formula.
我们用完了
秘密成分
到秘密公式。

01:24.209 --> 01:27.128
No!
不！

01:27.212 --> 01:28.588
Listen up, boy.
听着，男孩。

01:28.671 --> 01:30.590
Any minute now, a truck driver
is going to arrive
现在随时都有卡车司机
即将到达

01:30.673 --> 01:34.594
and I'm entrusting you to
retrieve the secret ingredient.
我委托你
取回秘密成分。

01:34.677 --> 01:37.889
And I need you to do this
without any foul-ups.
我需要你这样做
没有任何失误。

01:37.972 --> 01:39.891
Understand?
理解？

01:39.974 --> 01:41.100
Could you repeat that?
你能再说一遍吗？

01:41.184 --> 01:43.269
It's time!
是时候了！

01:52.320 --> 01:53.988
Now go!
现在走吧！

01:54.072 --> 01:55.907
And make sure to guard it
with your life!
并且一定要守护好它
与你的生命！

01:55.990 --> 01:57.116
I won't let you down.
我不会让你失望的。

01:57.200 --> 01:58.493
Wait!
等待！

01:58.576 --> 01:59.744
If something happens
to that secret ingredient
如果发生什么事
那个秘密成分

01:59.828 --> 02:03.164
don't bother coming
back to work.
不用麻烦来
回去工作。

02:12.298 --> 02:14.175
You Bob Pants?
你是鲍勃裤吗？

02:14.259 --> 02:15.426
Uh, SpongeBob.
呃，海绵宝宝。

02:15.510 --> 02:17.011
Close enough.
足够接近。

02:17.095 --> 02:18.680
Now get out of here, kid.
现在离开这里，孩子。

02:18.763 --> 02:20.265
Plenty of folks
would love to get a hold
of that ingredient.
很多人
很想抓住
该成分的。

02:20.348 --> 02:24.143
Yes, sir.
是的，先生。

02:24.227 --> 02:28.648
And now, let's get you
into the Krabby Patties,
secret "ingredienty."
现在，让我们来给你
放入蟹黄肉饼中，
秘密“成分”。

02:31.067 --> 02:34.445
Where is it?
它在哪里？

02:34.529 --> 02:36.155
Where is it, where is it?
它在哪里，它在哪里？

02:36.239 --> 02:38.032
No!
不！

02:38.116 --> 02:42.161
What's gonna happen to
the Krabby Patty secret recipe?
会发生什么事
蟹黄饼的秘方？

02:42.245 --> 02:43.329
What's this?
这是什么？

02:43.413 --> 02:44.497
A hole?
一个洞？

02:44.581 --> 02:46.124
How did that happen?
这是怎么发生的？

02:46.207 --> 02:47.709
A clean incision.
干净的切口。

02:47.792 --> 02:52.005
Almost as if someone,
or something,
did this on purpose.
几乎就像有人，
或者什么，
故意这样做的。

02:52.088 --> 02:53.756
That's it!
就是这样！

02:53.840 --> 02:56.885
A thief must've cut
a hole and swiped
the secret ingredient.
一定是小偷砍了
一个洞并被刷过
秘密成分。

02:56.968 --> 02:58.094
But who?
但谁呢？

02:58.177 --> 02:59.679
Mr. Krabs: SpongeBob!
蟹老板：海绵宝宝！

02:59.762 --> 03:01.306
What are you doing,
lollygagging about?
你在做什么，
棒棒哒？

03:01.389 --> 03:02.640
Get back to work.
回去工作吧。

03:02.724 --> 03:04.183
, Right away, sir.
，马上，先生。

03:04.267 --> 03:05.768
Hop to it.
跳到它。

03:05.852 --> 03:07.353
There's lots of hungry
customers out there.
还有很多饿的
那里的客户。

03:08.813 --> 03:10.607
Mr. Krabs trusted me,
and I let him down.
蟹老板信任我，
我让他失望了。

03:10.690 --> 03:12.150
Patrick: Hi, SpongeBob.
帕特里克：嗨，海绵宝宝。

03:12.233 --> 03:13.526
Hi, Patrick.
嗨，帕特里克。

03:13.610 --> 03:14.861
Maybe you can help me.
也许你可以帮助我。

03:14.944 --> 03:16.112
With what?
用什么？

03:16.195 --> 03:17.655
With this.
有了这个。

03:20.992 --> 03:22.327
Here you go, buddy.
给你，伙计。

03:22.410 --> 03:24.037
Not that kind of help.
不是那种帮助。

03:24.120 --> 03:26.539
This used to have
the Krabby Patty
secret ingredient inside.
这个曾经有过
蟹肉饼
里面有秘密成分。

03:26.623 --> 03:28.833
But now, it's missing.
但现在，它不见了。

03:28.917 --> 03:30.251
What?
什么？

03:30.335 --> 03:31.502
Someone stole it, Patrick.
有人偷了它，帕特里克。

03:31.586 --> 03:33.004
And we need to find out who.
我们需要找出是谁。

03:33.087 --> 03:34.422
Find out!
查出！

03:34.505 --> 03:38.593
You and I are gonna have to do
a little detective work.
你和我必须做
一点侦探工作。

03:38.676 --> 03:41.262
What are we eating
this time, Karen?
我们吃什么
这次，凯伦?

03:41.346 --> 03:42.722
Computer voice: Something new.
计算机语音：新东西。

03:42.805 --> 03:46.225
Oh, you mean the secret recipe
I came up with?
哦，你是说秘方
我想出了？

03:46.309 --> 03:47.560
SpongeBob: Ah-ha!
海绵宝宝：啊哈！

03:47.644 --> 03:48.937
I knew it was you!
我就知道是你！

03:49.020 --> 03:50.313
What was me?
我是什么？

03:50.396 --> 03:52.023
Oh, come on, Plankton.
哦，来吧，浮游生物。

03:52.106 --> 03:53.691
Don't play dumb.
别装傻。

03:53.775 --> 03:56.653
You know you stole the secret
Krabby Patty ingredient.
你知道你偷了秘密
蟹肉饼成分。

03:56.736 --> 03:58.821
Psh.
Is this a joke?
嘘。
这是一个笑话吗？

03:58.905 --> 04:00.031
Why don't you tell me?
你为什么不告诉我？

04:00.114 --> 04:01.824
Is it?
是吗？

04:01.908 --> 04:03.493
Uh... No?
呃……没有？

04:06.371 --> 04:07.914
Good one.
好一个。

04:09.332 --> 04:10.583
All right, no more jokes.
好了，不开玩笑了。

04:10.667 --> 04:12.168
Either you tell me where
the secret ingredient is
要么你告诉我在哪里
秘密成分是

04:12.251 --> 04:17.840
or we'll be forced to use
other means of making you talk.
否则我们将被迫使用
让你说话的其他方式。

04:19.759 --> 04:21.552
Sorry, I really
have nothing for you.
对不起，我真的
没有什么可以给你的。

04:21.636 --> 04:24.013
Then how do you explain this?
那你怎么解释呢？

04:25.306 --> 04:26.683
Ok, you've caught me.
好吧，你已经抓住我了。

04:26.766 --> 04:29.269
And so, the truth
floweth forth.
所以，事实是
流淌出来。

04:29.352 --> 04:32.188
Yes, it is a Krabby Patty.
是的，这是蟹黄饼。

04:32.271 --> 04:33.856
Mm-hm.
嗯嗯。

04:33.940 --> 04:36.275
But it's my version
of a Krabby Patty.
但这是我的版本
蟹肉饼。

04:37.860 --> 04:39.862
After thousands of failed
attempts to steal the recipe
在数以千计的失败之后
试图窃取食谱

04:39.946 --> 04:44.409
I learned all but one ingredient
needed to make Krabby Patties.
我学会了除了一种成分之外的所有成分
需要制作蟹黄馅饼。

04:44.492 --> 04:46.619
The most important ingredient.
最重要的成分。

04:46.703 --> 04:48.037
The secret ingredient.
秘密成分。

04:48.121 --> 04:50.123
Over the years,
I've methodically gone through
这些年来，
我有条不紊地经历了

04:50.206 --> 04:52.291
almost every letter
in the alphabet.
几乎每一个字母
在字母表中。

04:52.375 --> 04:56.212
Right now, I'm on the "R"s, and
I've gotten up to raw sewage.
现在，我处于“R”状态，并且
我已经开始处理未经处理的污水了。

04:57.338 --> 04:58.464
Yuck!
哎呀！

04:58.548 --> 05:01.009
Try it.
Tell me what you think.
尝试一下。
告诉我你的想法。

05:01.092 --> 05:02.343
Well, he's clean.
还好，他很干净。

05:02.427 --> 05:03.469
But if Plankton didn't steal
the ingredient, who did?
但如果浮游生物没有偷窃
成分，谁做的？

05:03.553 --> 05:05.513
Good question.
好问题。

05:05.596 --> 05:11.769
Only someone who specializes
in science could
reverse engineer the recipe
只有专门的人
在科学上可以
对配方进行逆向工程

05:11.853 --> 05:13.312
based on the secret ingredient.
基于秘密成分。

05:13.396 --> 05:16.232
Hm, a scientist.
嗯，科学家。

05:22.613 --> 05:24.907
There she is.
她就在那里。

05:26.159 --> 05:27.410
You hang back.
你退缩了。

05:27.493 --> 05:28.911
I'm going in for a closer look.
我要进去仔细看看。

05:35.668 --> 05:37.170
Oh my gosh.
天哪。

05:37.253 --> 05:39.297
It is Sandy.
这是桑迪。

05:40.757 --> 05:42.133
SpongeBob: Enjoying them
Krabby Patties, lady?
海绵宝宝：享受它们
蟹肉饼，女士？

05:42.216 --> 05:43.342
SpongeBob.
海绵宝宝。

05:43.426 --> 05:44.969
How long you been
standing there, buddy?
你来了多久了
站在那里，伙计？

05:45.053 --> 05:46.929
Oh, long enough, buddy.
哦，够久了，伙计。

05:47.013 --> 05:50.099
I was just storing food
for the impending winter.
我只是储存食物
为了即将到来的冬天。

05:50.183 --> 05:51.434
Want one?
想要一个吗？

05:51.517 --> 05:52.560
I'm on to you, squirrel.
我就看上你了，松鼠。

05:54.437 --> 05:57.523
You thought no one
could figure it out,
but I pieced it together.
你以为没有人
可以弄清楚，
但我把它拼凑起来。

05:57.607 --> 06:00.568
I know exactly how you got
all those Patties.
我很清楚你是怎么得到的
所有那些馅饼。

06:00.651 --> 06:02.737
What exactly are you
getting at, SpongeBob?
你到底是什么
海绵宝宝？

06:02.820 --> 06:09.160
What I am getting at
is that you cloaked yourself
in an invisibility potion...
我的意思是
是你把自己伪装起来
在隐形药水中...

06:09.744 --> 06:13.372
Snuck through
the security perimeter...
偷偷溜过去
安全边界...

06:13.456 --> 06:16.000
What was that?
那是什么？

06:16.834 --> 06:19.212
Here's the secret
Krabby Patty ingredient.
这是秘密
蟹肉饼成分。

06:19.295 --> 06:24.634
SpongeBob: Then used
a time-freezing device
to freeze time...
海绵宝宝：然后使用
时间冻结装置
冻结时间...

06:24.717 --> 06:27.178
used a laser beam
to cut open the case
使用激光束
切开箱子

06:27.261 --> 06:31.057
stole the Krabby Patty
secret ingredient,
reverse engineered it
偷了蟹肉饼
秘密成分，
对其进行逆向工程

06:31.140 --> 06:35.645
and made your own Patties,
so you wouldn't have to pay.
并制作了自己的肉饼，
这样你就不用付钱了。

06:35.728 --> 06:40.983
Or perhaps, I walked into
the Krusty Krab, purchased them
又或许，我走进
Krusty Krab，购买了它们

06:41.067 --> 06:45.488
and received a receipt for
these legally obtained Patties.
并收到收据
这些合法获得的肉饼。

06:45.571 --> 06:48.199
283 Krabby Patties.
283 蟹肉饼。

06:49.325 --> 06:50.451
That's right.
这是正确的。

06:50.535 --> 06:52.078
I cooked this order.
我煮了这个订单。

06:52.161 --> 06:54.455
I guess this means
you didn't use a laser beam
or invisibility.
我想这意味着
你没有使用激光束
或隐形。

06:54.539 --> 06:57.834
SpongeBob, next time,
before you run around
accusing people of things
海绵宝宝，下次
在你四处奔波之前
指责人的事情

06:57.917 --> 07:01.712
make sure your own house
is in order first.
确保你自己的房子
首先是有序的。

07:01.796 --> 07:04.799
My own house, huh?
我自己的房子吧？

07:04.882 --> 07:06.676
Why'd you do it, Gary?
你为什么这么做，加里？

07:08.845 --> 07:10.429
You've told us that story
100 times now, Gary.
你给我们讲过这个故事
现在已经100次了，加里。

07:10.513 --> 07:13.391
Unfortunately, my partner and I
don't want to hear stories.
不幸的是，我和我的伙伴
不想听故事。

07:13.474 --> 07:15.434
We want to hear the truth.
我们想听听真相。

07:15.518 --> 07:18.437
Look, we know you stole
the secret ingredient,
and it's obvious how you did it.
听着，我们知道你偷了
秘密成分，
很明显你是如何做到的。

07:18.521 --> 07:22.692
First, you hitched a ride
on a security chopper.
首先，你搭了便车
在安全直升机上。

07:22.775 --> 07:25.069
Then, jumped into
the drop zone.
然后，跳进了
下降区。

07:25.153 --> 07:29.157
And then, when I stopped
to pull up my sock
然后，当我停下来时
拉起我的袜子

07:29.240 --> 07:31.951
you snuck up behind me and did
what any snail could do.
你偷偷溜到我身后做了
任何蜗牛都能做的事。

07:32.034 --> 07:36.122
You shot corrosive acid
from your tear ducts,
which melted the case
你注射了腐蚀性酸液
从你的泪管，
融化了案件

07:36.205 --> 07:39.750
allowing you to steal
the secret ingredient.
允许你偷窃
秘密成分。

07:41.586 --> 07:42.545
Yeah, you're right, Gary.
是的，你是对的，加里。

07:42.628 --> 07:44.130
That is impossible.
那是不可能的。

07:44.213 --> 07:47.216
I never would have stopped
to pull up my sock
during a pickup.
我永远不会停止
拉起我的袜子
接送期间。

07:48.551 --> 07:49.677
What's that, Gary?
那是什么，加里？

07:51.053 --> 07:52.346
You did see someone
leaving the Krusty Krab
你确实看到了一个人
离开蟹堡王

07:52.430 --> 07:54.640
with a mysterious
black case that night?
带着神秘的
那天晚上的黑案？

07:54.724 --> 07:59.645
Mr. Snail, could you please
describe this, this marauder
to the sketch artist.
蜗牛先生，可以吗？
描述这个，这个掠夺者
给素描艺术家。

08:05.443 --> 08:06.652
I can't believe it!
我简直不敢相信！

08:06.736 --> 08:09.030
It was Squidward!
是章鱼哥！

08:11.699 --> 08:13.492
Open up in there, tentacles.
在那里张开，触手。

08:13.576 --> 08:14.785
We know you're in there.
我们知道你在里面。

08:14.869 --> 08:16.495
We just want to ask you
a few...
我们只是想问你
几个...

08:16.579 --> 08:17.622
He's not cooperating.
他不合作。

08:17.705 --> 08:20.208
You know what to do.
你知道该怎么做。

08:20.291 --> 08:21.667
And one, and...
还有一个，还有……

08:22.752 --> 08:23.836
We got you!
我们找到你了！

08:23.920 --> 08:25.004
You thought you could
hide your crimes.
你以为你可以
隐藏你的罪行。

08:25.087 --> 08:27.798
But we "hear-ed"
what you've done.
但我们“听到”
你做了什么。

08:27.882 --> 08:30.426
If I cared,
I'd ask what this is about.
如果我在乎的话
我想问一下这是关于什么的。

08:30.509 --> 08:32.178
Well, I'm glad you asked
嗯，我很高兴你问

08:32.261 --> 08:36.182
because this is about
you stealing the Krabby Patty
secret ingredient.
因为这是关于
你偷了蟹肉饼
秘密成分。

08:36.265 --> 08:38.935
And we have an eyewitness
who saw you leaving
我们有目击者
谁看见你离开

08:39.018 --> 08:42.730
the scene of the crime
with a mysterious black case.
犯罪现场
带着神秘的黑色案件。

08:42.813 --> 08:45.358
A case like this?
有这样的案例吗？

08:45.441 --> 08:46.734
Yes.
是的。

08:46.817 --> 08:48.444
Because you can't
make Krabby Patties without...
因为你不能
做蟹黄饼不...

08:50.446 --> 08:52.281
Tap dancing shoes?
踢踏舞鞋？

08:52.365 --> 08:53.991
That's right.
这是正确的。

08:54.075 --> 08:55.910
I was in a tap contest
on the night in question
我参加了踢踏舞比赛
在相关当晚

08:55.993 --> 08:59.205
as you can see from
my third place medallion.
正如你可以看到
我的第三名奖章。

08:59.288 --> 09:04.377
I guess this means you didn't
steal the secret ingredient.
我想这意味着你没有
窃取秘密成分。

09:08.673 --> 09:11.968
Get out of my house!
滚出我家！

09:17.056 --> 09:18.057
SpongeBob: Mr. Krabs!
海绵宝宝：蟹老板！

09:18.140 --> 09:19.725
I don't know how, sir, but...
我不知道怎么办，先生，但是...

09:19.809 --> 09:22.603
But somebody stole the
Krabby Patty secret ingredient!
但有人偷了
蟹黄饼秘方！

09:22.687 --> 09:24.563
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

09:24.647 --> 09:27.358
You were in charge of guarding
that secret ingredient
with your life.
你负责守护
那个秘密成分
与你的生活。

09:27.441 --> 09:28.901
I know, Mr. Krabs.
我知道，蟹老板。

09:28.985 --> 09:31.404
It just slipped away
from me somehow.
它就这么溜走了
以某种方式从我这里。

09:31.487 --> 09:33.739
Well, do you have
any leads or clues?
嗯，你有吗
有什么线索或线索吗？

09:33.823 --> 09:37.576
All I know is that
it had to be someone
who knew about the delivery
我只知道
一定是某人
谁知道送货的事

09:37.660 --> 09:39.870
and was at the Krusty Krab
during the delivery.
并在蟹堡王
交货期间。

09:39.954 --> 09:42.081
And this person
would have to know
而这个人
必须知道

09:42.164 --> 09:45.584
what to do with the secret
ingredient when he got it.
如何处理这个秘密
当他拿到原料时。

09:45.668 --> 09:48.921
That would be you, SpongeBob.
那就是你，海绵宝宝。

09:49.005 --> 09:50.715
You stole me secret ingredient.
你偷了我的秘密原料。

09:50.798 --> 09:52.425
Me?
That's right.
我？
这是正确的。

09:52.508 --> 09:55.052
And I know exactly
how you carried out
this little caper.
我确切地知道
你是如何进行的
这个小动作。

09:55.136 --> 09:59.181
You obviously set up a decoy
to take the delivery.
明显是你设下了诱饵
去提货。

09:59.265 --> 10:04.103
Then when no one was looking,
you swooped in,
stole the secret ingredient
然后趁没人看的时候，
你突然冲了进去
偷走了秘密成分

10:04.186 --> 10:06.314
and spirited it away
to The Chum Bucket
并把它偷偷带走
到密友桶

10:06.397 --> 10:09.525
where you sold it to Plankton
to make a quick buck.
你把它卖给 Plankton 的地方
赚快钱。

10:09.608 --> 10:11.444
Don't talk.
别说话。

10:11.527 --> 10:14.405
You can tell it to the cops,
'cause I'm calling 'em
right now.
你可以告诉警察，
因为我正在呼唤他们
现在。

10:14.488 --> 10:15.489
No need.
不需要。

10:15.573 --> 10:16.866
We heard it all
from this barrel.
我们都听到了
来自这个桶。

10:16.949 --> 10:19.076
Then arrest this thief,
officer.
然后逮捕这个小偷
官员。

10:19.160 --> 10:23.664
Mr. Krabs, isn't that
the stolen secret ingredient?
蟹老板，不是吗？
被盗的秘密成分？

10:25.124 --> 10:27.043
What are you talking
about, SpongeBob?
你在说什么
关于，海绵宝宝？

10:27.126 --> 10:29.128
I'm not holding
any secret ingredient.
我没有持有
任何秘密成分。

10:29.211 --> 10:32.131
Am I to understand that you
stole the item in question?
我是否应该理解你
偷了有问题的物品？

10:32.214 --> 10:35.134
Well, I wouldn't
call it stealing.
好吧，我不会
称之为偷窃。

10:35.217 --> 10:38.429
And you were gonna
let someone else take the fall
for this little caper.
而你本来打算
让别人承担责任
为了这个小动作。

10:38.512 --> 10:39.472
I can explain.
我可以解释一下。

10:39.555 --> 10:40.681
Please do.
请这样做。

10:40.765 --> 10:42.683
It's simple.
这很简单。

10:42.767 --> 10:46.270
$1.99 is a lot to pay
for the secret ingredient
every time I get a delivery
1.99 美元是很多钱
为了秘密成分
每次我收到货时

10:46.354 --> 10:50.733
so I... took it,
to avoid paying, you know.
所以我...接受了它，
为了避免付款，你知道。

10:50.816 --> 10:55.363
I think Judge Trout
will be very interested
to hear this little story.
我认为特劳特法官
会很感兴趣
来听听这个小故事。

10:55.446 --> 10:56.572
What?
什么？

10:56.655 --> 10:58.240
What'd I do?
我做了什么？

11:00.659 --> 11:02.620
All rise.
全部崛起。

11:02.703 --> 11:04.663
Eugene Krabs.
尤金·克拉布斯.

11:04.747 --> 11:06.332
Your honor.
启禀大人。

11:06.415 --> 11:09.585
As punishment for committing
the crime of grand theft
作为对犯罪行为的惩罚
盗窃罪

11:09.668 --> 11:15.841
I sentence you to give away
Krabby Patties for free
all day tomorrow.
我判你放弃
免费蟹肉饼
明天一整天。

11:15.925 --> 11:18.677
Give away me Patties for free?
免费送我馅饼吗？

11:18.761 --> 11:20.304
Oh, no.
哦，不。

11:20.388 --> 11:22.723
I couldn't bear
the sight of that.
我无法忍受
看到那个。

11:26.394 --> 11:29.522
Step right up and get
your free Krabby Patties.
向右走，得到
你的免费蟹肉饼。

11:58.926 --> 12:01.929
What is going on here?
这是怎么回事？

12:03.973 --> 12:05.516
Computer voice:
What's wrong now?
电脑语音：
现在怎么了？

12:05.599 --> 12:06.642
Same as always.
和往常一样。

12:06.725 --> 12:08.185
Look.
Empty again.
看。
又空了。

12:08.269 --> 12:10.729
So what are you gonna
do about it?
那么你要做什么
do about it?

12:10.813 --> 12:12.440
I don't know anymore!
我不知道了！

12:16.277 --> 12:17.820
Why don't you just work
on a new recipe?
你为什么不干活呢
新食谱？

12:17.903 --> 12:19.572
What's the point?
有什么意义？

12:19.655 --> 12:21.615
I haven't had
a customer in years.
我没有过
多年的客户。

12:21.699 --> 12:23.534
Male voice: Hello?
男声：喂？

12:23.617 --> 12:25.244
Away with you!
滚开你！

12:25.327 --> 12:27.538
Can't you see that
I'm self-loathing here?
你看不到吗
我在这里自我厌恶吗？

12:27.621 --> 12:28.706
Sorry.
对不起。

12:28.789 --> 12:30.916
I just wanted a chum stick.
我只是想要一根密棒。

12:31.000 --> 12:33.586
Yes, I'd like one
of your chum sticks.
是的，我想要一个
你的密友棒。

12:33.669 --> 12:34.837
You're kidding, right?
你在开玩笑吧？

12:34.920 --> 12:36.630
No, I'm serious.
不，我是认真的。

12:36.714 --> 12:37.631
I want a chum stick.
我想要一根密友棒。

12:37.715 --> 12:38.924
Uh, ok.
呃，好吧。

12:39.008 --> 12:42.678
If you insist.
如果你坚持的话。

12:42.761 --> 12:44.430
Oh no, please don't sue me.
哦不，请不要起诉我。

12:44.513 --> 12:45.764
Creature: Mm-mm.
生物：嗯嗯。

12:48.392 --> 12:52.438
I can't believe someone
actually enjoys my chum.
我无法相信某人
实际上很喜欢我的朋友。

12:54.106 --> 12:56.609
Now, this was so good, I'm gonna
have to come back tomorrow.
现在，这太好了，我要
明天必须回来。

12:56.692 --> 12:58.027
Here you go.
干得好。

12:58.110 --> 12:59.695
See you in the morning.
早上见。

12:59.778 --> 13:01.238
Did you see that?
你看到了吗？

13:01.322 --> 13:02.823
I didn't even have to
threaten his life.
我什至不必
威胁他的生命。

13:02.907 --> 13:04.575
He loved it!
他喜欢它！

13:04.658 --> 13:05.701
How'd you pull that off?
你是怎么做到的？

13:05.784 --> 13:07.036
Well, it's simple.
嗯，这很简单。

13:07.119 --> 13:08.496
Finally, someone came in
who has good taste.
终于有人进来了
谁有品味。

13:08.579 --> 13:10.372
And he's coming back tomorrow.
他明天就会回来。

13:10.456 --> 13:15.503
Excuse me, Karen,
but I got to whip up some more.
对不起，凯伦，
但我还得再做一些。

13:15.586 --> 13:16.837
Now, I wait.
现在，我等待。

13:16.921 --> 13:18.797
I wait until he returns.
我等他回来。

13:18.881 --> 13:21.050
I wait.
我等着。

13:21.300 --> 13:22.718
I wait.
我等着。

13:24.011 --> 13:25.679
I wait.
我等着。

13:27.932 --> 13:29.642
I wait.
我等着。

13:29.725 --> 13:31.602
French narrator:
Eight hours later.
法语解说员：
八个小时后。

13:34.188 --> 13:35.606
Huh, Nat, hello?
嗯，纳特，你好？

13:35.689 --> 13:36.815
Huh?
啊？

13:36.899 --> 13:39.193
What?
什么？

13:39.276 --> 13:42.488
Ugh, it's closing time.
呃，已经到关门时间了。

13:42.571 --> 13:46.325
I should've known it was
too good to be true.
我早该知道那是
好得令人难以置信。

13:46.408 --> 13:47.618
Hey.
嘿。

13:47.701 --> 13:49.328
Well, hello, Nat.
嗯，你好，纳特。

13:49.411 --> 13:50.996
I came back like
I said yesterday.
我回来了
我昨天说了。

13:51.080 --> 13:52.665
You certainly did, didn't you?
你当然这么做了，不是吗？

13:53.791 --> 13:55.334
I'd like another
chum stick, please.
我想要另一个
密友棒，请。

13:55.417 --> 13:57.461
Well, it's your lucky day, Nat.
好吧，今天是你的幸运日，纳特。

13:57.545 --> 14:00.965
I happen to have a quite
delectable one right here.
我碰巧有一个相当
美味的就在这里。

14:01.048 --> 14:02.883
Oh, boy.
哦，男孩。

14:06.095 --> 14:09.723
Is it ok?
可以吗？

14:09.807 --> 14:11.892
It's perfection!
太完美了！

14:14.228 --> 14:16.105
Hey, how about I have another?
嘿，我再来一个怎么样？

14:16.188 --> 14:20.025
You bet you.
你打赌你。

14:20.109 --> 14:21.902
Ooh, boy.
哦，男孩。

14:21.986 --> 14:23.821
I cannot believe how good
these things are.
我不敢相信有多好
这些事情是。

14:23.904 --> 14:25.030
Ah, well, you know.
啊，好吧，你知道。

14:25.114 --> 14:26.907
All right, see you tomorrow.
好的，明天见。

14:26.991 --> 14:28.158
What?
什么？

14:28.242 --> 14:29.868
You're coming back again?
你又回来了？

14:29.952 --> 14:31.579
Oh, you know it.
哦，你知道的。

14:31.662 --> 14:34.582
And the day after that,
and the next week after that.
而在那之后的一天，
以及之后的下周。

14:34.665 --> 14:39.044
You've got a regular customer
on your hands.
你有一个常客
在你的手上。

14:39.128 --> 14:40.546
Oh, my.
哦，我的。

14:40.629 --> 14:42.089
This is amazing.
这太棒了。

14:42.172 --> 14:44.550
At last, I've got my revenge.
终于，我报仇了。

14:49.471 --> 14:51.223
♪ Rolling, rolling, rolling ♪
♪ 滚滚滚滚滚滚 ♪

14:51.307 --> 14:54.727
♪ Money keeps on rolling
along ♪
♪ 钱不断滚滚而来
沿着♪

14:56.103 --> 14:57.771
One more time.
再一次。

14:57.855 --> 14:58.897
Whoa!
哇！

14:58.981 --> 15:00.399
No way, Plankton.
没办法，浮游生物。

15:00.482 --> 15:05.321
You're not getting me formula
this time or any time.
你没有给我公式
这次或任何时候。

15:07.948 --> 15:08.866
Don't bother.
别打扰。

15:08.949 --> 15:09.950
There's no need.
没必要吧

15:10.034 --> 15:11.410
What're you talking about?
你在说什么？

15:11.493 --> 15:15.497
I'm just saying, I no longer
need to copy you, Krabs.
我只是说，我不再
需要复制你，蟹蟹。

15:15.581 --> 15:18.709
I've got my own
winning recipe now.
我有我自己的
现在获胜的秘诀。

15:20.002 --> 15:21.503
You're really funny, man.
你真的很有趣，伙计。

15:21.587 --> 15:23.631
You think you can
compete with me?
你认为你可以
与我竞争？

15:23.714 --> 15:25.257
Look, Plankton.
看，浮游生物。

15:25.341 --> 15:27.176
Look at all these
loyal customers.
看看这一切
忠实的客户。

15:27.259 --> 15:29.762
Loyal to me, Plankton,
not to you.
忠于我，浮游生物，
不给你。

15:29.845 --> 15:31.096
Nat: Hey, Plankton!
纳特：嘿，浮游生物！

15:31.180 --> 15:32.931
Can I get another one
of your delicious chum sticks?
我可以再买一份吗
你的美味密友棒吗？

15:33.015 --> 15:35.976
But of course, loyal customer.
但当然，忠实的客户。

15:37.353 --> 15:39.063
I'll see you later, loser.
稍后再见，失败者。

15:39.146 --> 15:40.898
Much later.
很久以后。

15:42.107 --> 15:43.609
Oh no.
哦不。

15:43.692 --> 15:44.985
How can this be?
怎么会这样呢？

15:45.069 --> 15:46.028
Boy, front and center.
男孩，前面和中间。

15:46.111 --> 15:47.279
Yes, sir.
是的，先生。

15:47.363 --> 15:48.822
Plankton's trying
to overthrow me business.
浮游生物正在努力
推翻我的生意。

15:48.906 --> 15:51.450
He's got a customer
that actually likes his food.
他有一个顾客
其实很喜欢他的食物。

15:51.533 --> 15:55.996
You got to get that guy
back on our side with
a couple of Krabby Patties.
你必须得到那个人
回到我们这边
几块蟹肉饼。

15:56.080 --> 15:59.583
Oh, you can count on me, sir.
噢，你可以信赖我，先生。

16:01.085 --> 16:03.921
Pardon me, you smart fellow.
对不起，你这个聪明人。

16:04.004 --> 16:04.963
Down here.
下面这里。

16:07.299 --> 16:12.888
why settle for Plankton's lumpy
chum when you can enjoy a
steaming Krabby Patty for free?
为什么要满足于浮游生物的块状
好友，当你可以享受
免费蒸蟹肉饼？

16:14.223 --> 16:15.683
No, thanks.
不，谢谢。

16:21.730 --> 16:23.732
Barnacles.
藤壶。

16:25.067 --> 16:26.276
There he is.
他就在那里。

16:26.360 --> 16:29.738
Just in time for breakfast.
正好赶上吃早餐。

16:32.032 --> 16:33.325
Oh.
哦。

16:33.409 --> 16:35.327
I am such a clumsy oaf.
我真是个笨手笨脚的傻瓜。

16:35.411 --> 16:37.579
I sure hope nothing happens
to this Krabby Patty
我当然希望什么都没有发生
到这个克拉比帕蒂

16:37.663 --> 16:41.583
while I step carefully
over this rock here.
当我小心翼翼地迈步时
越过这里的这块岩石。

16:43.293 --> 16:45.671
Oh, no.
哦，不。

16:45.754 --> 16:47.047
Too late.
为时已晚。

16:47.131 --> 16:50.092
No, no!
不，不！

16:51.593 --> 16:52.678
Oops.
哎呀。

16:53.887 --> 16:54.930
Oops.
哎呀。

16:56.098 --> 16:57.015
Oops.
哎呀。

16:58.100 --> 16:59.393
Oh, come on, Nat.
哦，来吧，纳特。

16:59.476 --> 17:03.021
Just one accidental bite.
只是不小心被咬了一口。

17:04.606 --> 17:06.525
I see you're not
hungry right now.
我看你不是
现在饿了。

17:06.608 --> 17:09.153
But I'm telling you,
that Krabby Patty is gonna make
a great snack later.
但我告诉你，
蟹黄派蒂要做的
稍后再吃一顿很棒的小吃。

17:09.236 --> 17:10.863
Yeah, do me a favor.
是的，帮我一个忙。

17:10.946 --> 17:17.202
From now on, keep those
Shabby Patties to yourself.
从现在开始，保留这些
给自己吃破烂的馅饼。

17:17.286 --> 17:19.830
Oh, fish paste.
哦，鱼酱。

17:22.875 --> 17:23.876
Plankton: Nat.
浮游生物：纳特。

17:23.959 --> 17:25.294
Back already?
已经回来了吗？

17:25.377 --> 17:26.837
That's the fifth time today.
今天已经是第五次了。

17:26.920 --> 17:28.213
Not that I'm surprised.
我并不感到惊讶。

17:28.297 --> 17:33.218
Karen, babe, fetch Nat another
plate of that sweet chum.
凯伦，宝贝，再去接纳特吧
那盘甜蜜的密友。

17:33.302 --> 17:35.554
Yes, your diminutiveness.
是的，你的渺小。

17:35.637 --> 17:38.724
Say, Nat, do you
have any friends?
说，纳特，你吗？
有朋友吗？

17:38.807 --> 17:39.892
No.
不。

17:39.975 --> 17:42.895
♪ Doo-doo-doo,
doo-doo-doo-doo ♪
♪ 嘟嘟嘟，
嘟嘟嘟 ♪

17:44.605 --> 17:46.106
Would you hurry up
with that chum, Karen?
你能快点吗
和那个密友，凯伦？

17:46.190 --> 17:47.608
SpongeBob: Yeah, yeah, yeah.
海绵宝宝：是啊，是啊，是啊。

17:47.691 --> 17:50.152
Keep your tiny
pants on, Plankton.
保持你的小
穿上裤子，浮游生物。

17:50.235 --> 17:51.779
Bleep bloop.
嘟嘟嘟。

17:51.862 --> 17:53.030
There's your chum.
那是你的密友。

17:53.113 --> 17:54.615
Bleep blap blop.
嘟嘟嘟嘟。

17:54.698 --> 17:56.617
Hey, this doesn't
look like chum.
嘿嘿，这不是
看起来像密友。

17:56.700 --> 17:58.911
And that doesn't
look like Karen.
那不
看起来像凯伦。

17:58.994 --> 18:01.872
Why, don't be ridiculous,
my husband.
何必呢，别开玩笑了
我的丈夫。

18:01.955 --> 18:03.040
Bleep blap.
嘟嘟嘟。

18:03.123 --> 18:04.750
Of course it's me.
当然是我。

18:04.833 --> 18:07.002
What have you done
with Karen, you brute?
你做了什么
和凯伦在一起，你这个畜生？

18:09.713 --> 18:11.840
How many times do I
have to tell you?
我有多少次
必须告诉你吗？

18:11.924 --> 18:14.092
I don't want to eat your trash!
我不想吃你的垃圾！

18:14.176 --> 18:18.138
Plankton's chum is my favorite
breakfast, lunch, and dinner.
浮游生物的密友是我的最爱
早餐、午餐和晚餐。

18:18.222 --> 18:21.058
I love chum!
我爱密友！

18:21.141 --> 18:22.601
So forget it.
所以算了吧。

18:22.684 --> 18:24.686
I don't want
to eat anything else.
我不想要
吃别的东西。

18:24.770 --> 18:28.524
So you're saying
that you love chum?
所以你是说
你爱密友吗？

18:28.607 --> 18:31.193
And all that you ever
eat is chum?
以及你曾经的一切
吃的是密友吗？

18:31.276 --> 18:32.986
Yeah, that's right.
是的，没错。

18:33.070 --> 18:35.739
Interesting.
有趣的。

18:40.661 --> 18:43.080
A shortcut to The Chum Bucket.
通往密友桶的捷径。

18:43.163 --> 18:45.040
Hm, that must be for me.
嗯，那一定是为了我。

18:52.047 --> 18:54.258
Welcome, valued customer.
欢迎，尊贵的客户。

18:54.341 --> 18:56.301
This isn't The Chum Bucket.
这不是密友桶。

18:58.470 --> 19:03.976
Why go to The Chum Bucket
when the Krusty Krab has added
tasty chum to our menu?
为什么要去密友桶
当蟹堡王添加时
我们菜单上的美味佳肴？

19:04.059 --> 19:05.602
That's ok.
没关系。

19:05.686 --> 19:07.646
I only eat
Chum Bucket brand chum.
我只吃
Chum Bucket 品牌密友。

19:07.729 --> 19:10.983
But we've developed
a special recipe for the most
discerning chum lovers.
但我们已经开发了
为大多数人准备的特殊食谱
挑剔的好友恋人。

19:11.066 --> 19:13.986
Besides, I've locked
all the exits until
you give it a try.
另外我已经锁了
所有出口直到
你试试吧。

19:14.069 --> 19:15.571
So what do you say?
那你说呢？

19:21.326 --> 19:22.744
You like it?
你喜欢吗？

19:24.037 --> 19:25.289
It's...
它是...

19:25.372 --> 19:26.832
Yeah?
是的？

19:26.915 --> 19:27.958
It's...
它是...

19:29.626 --> 19:31.628
Well, what do you think?
嗯，你觉得怎么样？

19:31.712 --> 19:35.257
It's the second foulest thing
I've ever tasted.
这是第二个最肮脏的事情
我曾经尝过。

19:37.718 --> 19:40.387
I'm going back
to Plankton's chum.
我要回去了
给 Plankton 的好友。

19:40.470 --> 19:42.014
What am I gonna do?
我要做什么？

19:42.097 --> 19:45.350
I can't let Plankton have
so much as one single customer.
我不能让浮游生物拥有
就一个客户而言。

19:45.434 --> 19:47.853
: I just
can't afford it.
: 我只是
买不起。

19:49.855 --> 19:51.982
I guess you'll have to make chum
that's as good as Plankton's.
我猜你得交个朋友
和 Plankton 的一样好。

19:52.065 --> 19:56.361
But to do that, I'd need to know
how Plankton makes his chum.
但要做到这一点，我需要知道
浮游生物如何成为他的密友。

19:56.445 --> 19:59.990
Hm.
嗯。

20:00.073 --> 20:01.867
That's it, boy-o.
就是这样，男孩。

20:08.624 --> 20:10.125
Where could it be?
它可能在哪里？

20:10.208 --> 20:11.543
There.
那里。

20:11.627 --> 20:13.587
Plankton's secret formula.
浮游生物的秘密配方。

20:13.670 --> 20:15.172
It's got to be in here.
它一定在这儿。

20:21.553 --> 20:23.096
what do you think, Krabs, baby?
蟹蟹宝贝，你觉得怎么样？

20:23.180 --> 20:29.019
This time, I caught you trying
to steal my secret formula.
这一次，我发现你在尝试
窃取我的秘密配方。

20:29.102 --> 20:30.604
Ironic, isn't it?
很讽刺，不是吗？

20:30.687 --> 20:33.690
Unfortunately, I have
no way of knowing.
不幸的是，我有
没有办法知道。

20:33.774 --> 20:36.985
You see, crabs are not born with
an innate inkling of irony.
你看，螃蟹并不是与生俱来的
与生俱来的讽刺意味

20:37.069 --> 20:38.153
Ouch.
哎哟。

20:38.236 --> 20:39.404
Double irony.
双重讽刺。

20:39.488 --> 20:40.864
SpongeBob: Triple
irony, Plankton.
海绵宝宝：三重
讽刺的是，浮游生物。

20:40.948 --> 20:43.659
Though you nabbed Krabs
trying to steal your formula
虽然你抓到了螃蟹
试图窃取你的公式

20:43.742 --> 20:46.078
I'm still here to foil
your evil plans.
我还在这里陪衬
你的邪恶计划。

20:46.161 --> 20:49.498
So it's like a dollop of irony
on top of an ironic twist.
所以这就像一团讽刺
讽刺的转折之上。

20:50.916 --> 20:52.501
SpongeBob: I mean,
just think about that.
海绵宝宝：我的意思是，
想想看。

20:52.584 --> 20:57.089
You know, in a weird way,
it's like we never left the...
你知道，以一种奇怪的方式，
就好像我们从未离开过...

20:57.172 --> 21:00.717
Good thing I sprang for
the dual spoon installation.
还好我为之而跳
双勺安装。

21:00.801 --> 21:03.095
Karen: Call it
a computer's intuition
凯伦： 叫它
计算机的直觉

21:03.178 --> 21:08.392
but I sense your regular
approaching with an unusually
large wad of cash.
但我感觉到你经常
以异常的方式接近
大叠现金。

21:08.475 --> 21:11.228
Look at all that loot.
看看所有这些战利品。

21:11.311 --> 21:12.729
Plankton: That's right, Krabs.
浮游生物：没错，蟹蟹。

21:12.813 --> 21:14.856
And you're gonna have to
keep looking when my customer
你必须
当我的客户继续寻找

21:14.940 --> 21:18.151
comes in and pays me
for my chum.
进来并付钱给我
为了我的密友。

21:18.235 --> 21:22.489
Oh, just put me
out of me misery.
哦，就放我吧
摆脱我的痛苦。

21:22.572 --> 21:26.034
Back for more of
my delicious chum, I see.
返回查看更多
我的好朋友，我明白了。

21:26.118 --> 21:27.786
Not this time.
这次不是。

21:27.869 --> 21:28.620
Huh?
啊？

21:28.704 --> 21:30.372
Not ever again.
再也不会了。

21:30.455 --> 21:32.165
The deal's off, computer.
交易结束了，电脑。

21:32.249 --> 21:34.209
I can't eat another bite
of that slop, no matter
how much you pay me.
我再也吃不下一口了
那个斜坡，无论
你付给我多少钱。

21:35.419 --> 21:37.421
Huh?
啊？

21:37.504 --> 21:42.342
I have eaten 10 of those things,
and I've already had to go
to the doctor, twice.
这些东西我已经吃了10个了
我已经不得不走了
去看医生，两次。

21:49.975 --> 21:55.063
if you need me, I'll be getting
my stomach pumped... again.
如果你需要我，我会得到
我的胃再次抽动。

21:57.357 --> 21:59.276
What's the deal, Karen?
怎么了，凯伦？

21:59.359 --> 22:04.823
The deal was that I paid Nat
to eat your chum so you'd quit
your constant complaining.
这笔交易是我付给 Nat
吃掉你的密友，这样你就会退出
你不断的抱怨。

22:04.906 --> 22:12.122
All this time, I never
had one regular customer?
一直以来，我从来没有
有一位常客吗？

22:12.205 --> 22:13.290
Karen: Duh.
凯伦：呃。

22:13.373 --> 22:14.791
I should have known.
我应该知道的。

22:14.875 --> 22:17.377
Why would anyone
ever eat my slop?
为什么有人会
吃过我的泔水吗？

22:17.461 --> 22:19.671
Ugh, there he goes again.
呃，他又来了。

22:19.755 --> 22:21.214
Cut it out, Plankton.
别说了，浮游生物。

22:21.298 --> 22:23.258
What?
什么？

22:23.341 --> 22:27.387
It's just obvious that I'm
a complete failure and a waste
of a lower life form.
很明显我是
彻底的失败和浪费
属于低等生命形式。

22:27.471 --> 22:29.931
Oh, woe is me.
哦，祸哉是我。

22:31.141 --> 22:32.267
Quickly.
迅速地。

22:32.350 --> 22:34.019
Now is the time
to beat a hasty retreat.
现在是时候了
仓促撤退。

22:34.102 --> 22:35.187
What?
什么？

22:35.270 --> 22:36.521
And miss this?
还想念这个吗？

22:36.605 --> 22:37.898
I've never enjoyed meself more.
我从未如此享受过。

22:37.981 --> 22:39.524
This irony's pretty good stuff.
这讽刺真是好东西。

这讽刺真是好东西。